+- masks and slot mapping: shape/type/uniqueness checks, all 28 coordinates, audit-row exclusion, and physical identity round trips;
+- lowest-index ties and empty masks: tested both the bridge and the actual legacy adapter implementation;
+- joint invalidity: valid profiles pass; invalid profiles raise without repair; no-op is accepted only on an empty mask;
